#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Maps"
msgstr "Chartas"

#: src/postulo/plugins/maps/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Show where the companies are on a map, placing each postal address offline at its postcode or its town from tables kept on this server, or where you put it by hand; a contact's address and your own are drawn only when you ask, and their points are kept with them and erased with them. The map is drawn by Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) over OpenStreetMap's tiles (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL) unless Settings chooses other tiles or none; OpenStreetMap then learns each viewer's address and the area they look at. Places come from GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; its postal codes CC BY 4.0), the country names from the Unicode CLDR through Babel, and the world outline from Natural Earth (public domain). Switched off, there is no map page and no address is placed; the coordinates already stored stay recorded and come back untouched when it is switched on again."
msgstr "Mussar sin ina charta nua che las interpresas sa chattan, cun plazzar mintga adressa postala offline tar ses numer postal u ses lieu a basa da tabellas conservadas sin quest server, u là nua che Vus l'avais messa a maun; l'adressa d'in contact e Vossa atgna vegnan mussadas mo sche Vus dumandais, e lur puncts vegnan conservads cun ellas ed eliminads cun ellas. La charta vegn generada da Leaflet (BSD-2-Clause) sur ils tegls dad OpenStreetMap (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL), nun che Parameters tscherna auters tegls u nagins; OpenStreetMap vegn lura a savair l'adressa da mintga spectatur e la regiun ch'el guarda. Ils lieus vegnan da GeoNames (CC BY 3.0; ses numers postals CC BY 4.0), ils nums dals pajais dal Unicode CLDR via Babel ed il contur dal mund da Natural Earth (domena publica). Deactivà, na datti nagina pagina da charta e nagina adressa na vegn plazzada; las coordinatas gia memorisadas restan registradas e returnan intactas cura ch'el vegn reactivà."
